23e181f5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-88234a52-55aa-4da9-8bf6-5a52fdaf8d38\">서민금융으로 대위변제가 되면 카톡이나 문자로 알람이가고</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d5107379-15f2-4a36-b1b9-72fdd5b17dcd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1cb3ae0e-b7cc-43af-8d13-08e57e54b0f1\">그 알람을 확인하면 따로 우편물 발송이없다네요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d98c850a-a650-4586-a2d2-2fb95244c019\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-58fceef2-8d83-4224-af46-3c05712da6a7\">(우편물방어 참고하세요)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7886994a-89f2-429b-a05b-a2eb8658e3c6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ce90cc97-d4eb-4d70-b9f2-500a6dda0e36\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-54e0fed8-d774-4f73-b8d5-3f762e162ec5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-72b11c48-9b33-4bf2-be65-ce6fc2de5882\">몇몆분들이</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b61089c-0d36-4daa-92b2-2a8abc4283ca\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-88871193-6515-4ca2-96e4-7cb5510a73d2\">새출발 부실우려(신속) 신청후 대출건들 연체하면</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0e006583-fa79-4a6b-9e4f-8316cd16c654\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bb2a5acd-d458-48f1-a840-5bb87f131642\">나이스,올크에 연체정보가 공유되는거로 아셔서</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bfd71b84-2e8e-4c44-b662-ceced7f01f74\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-74fbdde1-bb59-491e-ba68-9dfa3c3d82a1\">불안해 하시는데요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-78f91283-ebc8-4369-a0a9-fb74abf3c930\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-68cbd017-7538-4f4e-ac2b-6e5558b079b5\">연체기록은 대출받은 금융사에만 등록되어요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cb7b7fca-d5c8-4c59-bf9f-c4b7f95b4108\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e921f2bf-b6dc-4dbf-9fcf-a527006f1fc7\">그래서 추심,압류,연체정보공유 없으니 첫납입까지 3개월</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-942a20f9-075b-4303-ae56-77442c1ee667\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-17aec443-01ab-4ad1-a946-1bcda6e119f0\">정도 걸리니 열심히 돈버시면 됩니다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-105a4ac1-df51-4ece-aa3d-7c363cb693f7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4084843e-ee72-4466-afc9-bc695ab79e2c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1aed9e58-60fd-46ec-bec0-33a562a7fec1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c973afe3-b8b7-4c36-badb-e7329e276831\">다시한번</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-13af68e0-7fd7-457d-ac26-d4eb35034f61\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d2f6b150-cf1b-4438-b033-0943944248af\">처음 동의된 채권 에이원대부는 신용정보사에</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1c2eea78-2142-4aef-8173-5699f8b6c31c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e185233f-ee75-46ab-b18c-b78fc8c1e2d2\">그대로 대출목록에 잡혀있고</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=